{"title":"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In Figure 1, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> has points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, respectively, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db041d9c0fda44cf24b4f4ae7f02243ef2ea7f92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADE$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> are <i>similar triangles</i> because their corresponding angles are equal. These triangles thus have the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c4323880775202982e34374bb491cb554986e14d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AD}{AB} = \\frac{AE}{AC} = \\frac{DE}{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"150\" height=\"39\" />.<br />\nIn Figure 2, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> is a trapezoid with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/434b43c3ed50dfcfe55a5a68619bfe75826a1aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WX$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/1/191926b2b0c55c3573755e06476b3b6c16aa1f8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ZY$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />. Also, points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and are on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f6fdf2d48244959cf6c66b683a59d4e63e5423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WZ$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7774174993ffa29a38cf577ae34d8e0a3a63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />, respectively, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcfabd65745f2b759dea1840f9a0753b2f992e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/434b43c3ed50dfcfe55a5a68619bfe75826a1aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WX$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/1/191926b2b0c55c3573755e06476b3b6c16aa1f8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ZY$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A (page does not exist)\">2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B (page does not exist)\">2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part C (page does not exist)\">2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part C</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody>