blem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062002\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 172/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1655/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3320/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.250      1 -total\n 54.66%    6.696      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 44.06%    5.397      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37099:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018062002 and revision id 286418. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}